          "ImageDescription": {
            "value": "Screenshot of the mod \"NodeCore\" for Minetest. The mod has a slightly different gameplay than the basic Minetest. So there are Achievements, and the possibility to run. There is no kind of inventory like that, and crafting happens in the world. At the beginning you have no items, and you have to mine materials. NodeCore is considered one of the most popular mods for Minetest, but it is considered relatively hard when it comes to difficulty. There are hardly any hints or help, a lot of things have to be figured out by yourself.",
            "source": "commons-desc-page"
          },
